--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e17b972750c34bd4b903f60c7caf8be2, type: 3}
  m_Name: "COLLECTIBLE 5 - CAPTAIN + REN\xC9E"
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subtitles:
  - line: "Oh, my! I didn\u2019t know the captain herself would be coming down."
    seconds: 7.134
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Yes, well, there\u2019s not much\u2026"
    seconds: 9.531
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Then we\u2019ll move to the sick ward."
    seconds: 17.684
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Oh, err, you may not want to walk in there right now, Ma\u2019am."
    seconds: 20.773
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Ren\xE9e, you know we can\u2019t overlook any item during inspection."
    seconds: 24.433
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Of course!
    seconds: 25.253
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "[subtly teasing] \u201CUnless there\u2019s a mess in there you were hoping
      to clean up before I saw it?"
    seconds: 28.511
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "No, no, it\u2019s just that one of the lieutenants responded poorly to
      his IV therapy,"
    seconds: 33.688
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: and there was a mishap with some of the fluid samples.
    seconds: 36.221
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Fluids?
    seconds: 37.145
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Blood, Ma\u2019am."
    seconds: 38.532
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: I see.
    seconds: 39.626
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: '[quietly] Among others.[hastily] We have it under control, of course.'
    seconds: 41.989
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "If you would just give us an hour or two to air it out\u2026"
    seconds: 44.279
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "That won\u2019t be necessary, Ren\xE9e."
    seconds: 46.287
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "I\u2019ve been through worse, and anyway, it\u2019s not the ugliest mess
      the Pandora is carrying."
    seconds: 51.925
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Ma\u2019am? Are the engineers acting up again?"
    seconds: 54.721
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Oh, uh, no. They\u2019re fine.  Never mind it."
    seconds: 58.979
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Well, I\u2019d hope they\u2019re fine! You know, they\u2019re the ones
      we see coming in most often."
    seconds: 62.627
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: One of them came down with insomnia. Poor guy said he kept hearing rumbling
      in the walls after hours.
    seconds: 67.306
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "I said, of course he\u2019d be hearing things, after working in the machine
      shafts all day,"
    seconds: 71.023
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: but we gave him some risperidone, regardless.
    seconds: 74.305
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "[privately concerned] \u201CThanks for bringing that to my attention."
    seconds: 76.431
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Let me know if there are any more abnormal issues.
    seconds: 79.784
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Certainly.
    seconds: 80.658
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  audioName: "COLLECTIBLE 5 - CAPTAIN + REN\xC9E"
